    <string name="health_section_why">Why tracking can stop</string>
    <string name="health_why_body">Battery saver, or battery use set to “Restricted”, can stop Tarry in the background. On some phones, force stopping the app or swiping it away does the same. Turning off a permission stops tracking until you turn it back on. So does turning off location services.</string>

